  "question": {
    "text": "In the Claisen-Schmidt reaction to prepare, dibenzalacetone from 5.3 g of benzaldehyde, a total of 3.51 g of product was obtained. The percentage yield in this reaction was ______ %."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "60",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0007_f784089bc721.png\"><br>\n\n\n\n\n$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { Theoretical }=\\frac{1}{40} \\mathrm{Mol} \\\\ & \\% \\text { yield }=\\frac{0.015}{1 / 40} \\times 100 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow 60 \\%\\end{aligned}$"
  }
}